# Select shortcut demo at normal speed (feat_field_menu.py): Select -> save screen, B -> System, Select -> map;
# X, A (Status), Select -> map; Select -> save screen, Select -> map. Saves 'field' in Jian's room first:
# EmuHawk --config=build/view_config.ini --load-state=<out>/states/field.State build/dsde.nds
include boot_from_save
wait 250
save field
speed 100
wait 120
press Select 3
wait 150
press B 3
wait 120
press Select 3
wait 150
press X 3
wait 90
press A 3
wait 120
press Select 3
wait 150
press Select 3
wait 150
press Select 3
wait 240
